{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "141", "x": 0.8997849334044037, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03395831519923213, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Example overview", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.19398802898134385, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "The main stages of bamboo fabric production include harvesting bamboo plants,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1613150258338729, "w": 0.826077001571605, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "putting them through processes to extract the fibres, then spinning and weaving", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1896453759080105, "w": 0.8259029142000445, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "those fibres to create fabric.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21797572598214812, "w": 0.293582076300506, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Great composition [ Candidate composition]", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2568372853030363, "w": 0.4488263097075855, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.0 score.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.28520475322740463, "w": 0.7345046091630857, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "The way many of us are dressed today is believed to be affected by the fashion", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3135351033015423, "w": 0.8069849328302638, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "industry. The reason why it is so importent for some people to choose their", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.34186543451498363, "w": 0.8067454345381758, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "clothes according to the trends may be in our dependence on what is popular at", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.37019586003190624, "w": 0.8077089640540335, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the moment which is a double-edged sword. Of course, trying to keep up with", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.42685659790157404, "w": 0.8072697471519337, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "modern fads consumes pretty much time and energy, but is it really that", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.45503862746035895, "w": 0.8067455370631297, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "negative in terms of maintaining individuality? To my mind, it is not.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4833937227679837, "w": 0.68330528763222, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Not surprisingly, global fashion has influenced people's tastes in clothing a", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5117241105635139, "w": 0.8068762563792308, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "great deal. We all see those celebrities on TV and on the Internet boasting their", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5400544606376515, "w": 0.8071593277766859, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "brand new outfit making many men and women jealous. Would blond hair in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5683848484331816, "w": 0.8076415026344299, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "concert with a white dress have been so popular back in the day if it had not", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5967151985073192, "w": 0.8068762563792308, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "been for the voloptious Marlyn Monroe? world-wide famous fashion designers", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6250455863028493, "w": 0.8073340302979694, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "keep surprising consumers with their wild imagination producing more and more", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.653375936376987, "w": 0.8072026958321453, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "types of style. For instance over-sized winter coats have drawn attention not", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6817434043013553, "w": 0.8072536507341863, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "only from the youth but from the middle-aged as well.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7100737543754929, "w": 0.5516281834126313, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Fashions by many are believed to dictate people how to look. They impose new", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7384041044496306, "w": 0.8068326832738637, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "styles, and some people wear certain clothes just because another designer told", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7667345299665532, "w": 0.8075392852554866, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "them to do so.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7950648800406909, "w": 0.14799651374147083, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Looking on the bright side, there's absolutely no harm in getting advice from the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8233952301148284, "w": 0.8070502412258376, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "fashion industry on what to wear this season. Moderation is the key. Do not", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8517256556317511, "w": 0.8068763589041846, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "overdo it. If you put on a garment that is really comfortable and suitable for you,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8800807509393759, "w": 0.8075546639985572, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}